{"reviewId": "28739203_86tpXaI3o", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "所以2008～2018是衰退期？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2121", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "28739203_86tpXaI3o", "userVid": 28739203, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769521517, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 28739203, "name": "飞流", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/iba1g4BQkl0neUicicicw4LVAt9GRYUlEJuict48NUXmrnPhEp6IxiaIwDUSpOyXByaEiaZXHagAvPbxRxicia1icRKIRmgzMj22ycBBXBHUsBOcb5Efg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 268046218, "name": "🐰 eudaimonia(终身学习）", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0011-rSe7ER4Wxz3_VFszoqAK1f9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🐰 eudaimonia(终身学习）", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "书籍治愈我peace and love", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "上升期", "reviewId": "28739203_86tpXaI3o", "commentId": "28739203_86tpXaI3o_c17426439_86JOd9MM